#: scenario2:scenario2_A177F07C_1047_463B_BCE9_0F87C9060DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9584739fcb52b16ae9c8463d34cae3f2f758f327a196b8467e38564768294c20
