msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would understand if he had puffed his chest in pride, but far from that, his terror merely "
"intensified."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il aurait été tout naturel qu’il bombe le torse d’orgueil mais, bien au contraire, sa "
"terreur ne faisait qu’augmenter."

