#: scenario2:scenario2_DD4689FB_0486_4EB5_A3C2_1A6CB1819498
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efa30787da4981d436c59ea8b29e1889ad6fde0fc02e1978f38a0333adb530a7
