msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl extended her hand for Bestia, but even her gentle, lovingly "
"outstretched fingers evoked fear in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs lui tendit la main, mais même ses gestes doux et aimants "
"suscitaient la peur dans les yeux de Bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_400323D7_091A_4CF2_AE51_55BC14600017
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4769a217df0acdbf416f30f3028252dc8e5411a8f9f68e0b433c6dae0241d5eb
